    <briefdescription>
<para>Singleton object-pool manager for LogText notification elements. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Pre-allocates a fixed pool and recycles entries when their animations finish. Notifications can be suppressed globally with SetNotificationsEnabled. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
